        {
            "structuredValue": [],
            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "The files contained here include magnetic field simulation data and code to use the data for the generation of the magnetic separation device (MSD) used for the development of the integrated basophil isolation device (i-BID). Also includes is a video demonstrating the operation of the i-BID.",
